### List open incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents?limit=10


### Get incident by id
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents/f81c4ce8-2cff-44c1-aceb-7e2a9450e8c1


### Get incident evidence
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents/f81c4ce8-2cff-44c1-aceb-7e2a9450e8c1/evidence

### Acknowledge incident
POST http://localhost:8080/incidents/f81c4ce8-2cff-44c1-aceb-7e2a9450e8c1/acknowledge


### Resolve incident
POST http://localhost:8080/incidents/f81c4ce8-2cff-44c1-aceb-7e2a9450e8c1/resolve

### List active incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents?limit=10


### List open incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents?status=OPEN&limit=10


### List acknowledged incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents?status=ACKNOWLEDGED&limit=10

### Get incident alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents/c5cb2bac-efdd-46de-a6a7-79d053b54be0/alerts


### List resolved incidents
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents?status=RESOLVED&limit=10

### Get incident timeline
GET http://localhost:8080/incidents/<INCIDENT_ID>/timeline